The checked-in parser uses the public-domain Berkeley Yacc 2.0 (20260126)
parser skeleton, not GNU Bison. Regenerate in this directory:

  byacc -l -d -b awkgram awkgram.y
  cc -D_GNU_SOURCE maketab.c -o maketab
  ./maketab awkgram.tab.h >proctab.c

bx prefixes interpreter globals and does not run shell commands from system()
or pipes. Ordinary file redirection and ENVIRON remain available.
